       <h1>Actor Vishal Sustains Back Injury During 'Purushan' Climax Shoot</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Vishal</span> <span>#Purushan</span> <span>#Injury</span> <span>#Nadigar Sangam</span></div>
       <p>Actor Vishal recently sustained a back injury during an action sequence for his upcoming film, 'Purushan', while shooting in Goa. The incident took place during the crucial climax portion of the movie, requiring the actor to seek immediate medical attention for the ailment.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-27/actor-vishal-sustains-back-injury-during-purushan-climax-sho.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Doctors attending to Vishal have prescribed a recovery period of three weeks. This unforeseen hiatus has reportedly caused disappointment for the actor, as it will regrettably prevent him from participating in the important Nadigar Sangam general body meeting. His absence from this key organizational event marks a significant personal setback amidst his recovery.</p><p>In the wake of the injury, Vishal has acknowledged and expressed his deep gratitude for the overwhelming support he has received from his dedicated fanbase. The outpouring of well-wishes and concern from his admirers has been a source of encouragement during this challenging time.</p><p>The actor is now focused on healing swiftly, emphasizing his eagerness to return to his professional duties. He is keen to resume both his film commitments and his responsibilities within various organizational capacities as soon as his health permits. His commitment to his craft and industry roles remains strong.</p><p>What to watch: Further updates on Vishal's recuperation and the resumption of the 'Purushan' production schedule.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately captures the details provided in the source summary regarding the injury and the actor's professional status.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/tamil/movies/news/vishal-suffers-back-injury-during-purushan-climax-shoot-in-goa-im-sorry-i-cannot-attend-the-nadigar-sangam-general-body-meeting/articleshow/134515036.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
