     <article class="story single" data-beat="sports">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · BBC Sport · 2026-09-27 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Banton's Maiden Century Secures England ODI Series Win Against Sri Lanka</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#Sports</span> <span>#England</span> <span>#Sri Lanka</span></div>
       <p>Tom Banton delivered a standout performance, realizing his potential by scoring a brilliant maiden international century, which propelled England to an ODI series victory over Sri Lanka. This exceptional display allowed the England team to conclude their summer cricket engagements on a triumphant note.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-27/bantons-maiden-century-secures-england-odi-series-win-agains.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Banton's century was a pivotal moment in the series, showcasing his capabilities and proving instrumental in securing the win. The innings marked a significant personal milestone for the player, fulfilling much of the promise that has been associated with his talent on the international stage. His commanding batting performance provided the crucial momentum for England.</p><p>The series triumph against Sri Lanka enabled England to successfully wrap up their summer schedule, reinforcing their strong standing in One Day International cricket. Banton's significant contribution was central to this success, as his powerful and precise batting laid the foundation for England's decisive victory.</p><p>This performance further underscores Banton's growing importance as a key player for the national side. The ODI series win serves as a strong and positive conclusion to England's summer of cricket, largely driven by Banton's individual brilliance. His memorable century will undoubtedly be highlighted as a defining moment of the season.</p><p>What to watch: England's upcoming white-ball fixtures.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately summarizes the provided cricket match result.</p>
