       <h1>From IIT Bombay to Sarvam AI: Pratyush Kumar's Journey in India's AI Future</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#IIT Bombay</span> <span>#Pratyush Kumar</span> <span>#Sarvam AI</span> <span>#Artificial Intelligence</span></div>
       <p>Pratyush Kumar, a co-founder of Sarvam AI, is making significant contributions to India's burgeoning artificial intelligence sector. His journey originates from the esteemed Indian Institute of Technology (IIT) Bombay, marking a notable trajectory in the technology landscape.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-27/from-iit-bombay-to-sarvam-ai-pratyush-kumars-journey-in-indi.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Kumar's career path illustrates a progression from his foundational education at IIT Bombay towards building the future of AI in India. As a co-founder of Sarvam AI, he is positioned at the forefront of developing innovative solutions within this critical technological domain.</p><p>The narrative of Pratyush Kumar highlights a transition from a premier engineering institution to a leadership role in an AI company. Sarvam AI, under his co-foundership, is actively involved in shaping the country's capabilities in artificial intelligence. This endeavor reflects a commitment to advancing India's technological prowess.</p><p>His background from IIT Bombay provides a strong academic foundation for his current role. The company, Sarvam AI, is dedicated to contributing to the nation's AI future, with Kumar playing a pivotal role in this mission. This journey underscores the talent emerging from India's top educational institutions to drive national technological growth.</p><p>What to watch: Future innovations and contributions from Sarvam AI in India's AI sector.</p>
