     <article class="story single" data-beat="sports">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">SPORTS</span> · NDTV Sports · 2026-09-27 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>India vs West Indies LIVE Score, 1st ODI: Kuldeep Yadav Tears Through WI Batting, Scalps 2 Wickets In 2 Balls After Justin Greaves' 100</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Cricket</span> <span>#India</span> <span>#West Indies</span> <span>#ODI</span></div>
       <p>The first One Day International between India and West Indies in Thiruvananthapuram has witnessed a compelling narrative, marked by both individual batting brilliance and a subsequent bowling masterclass. West Indies opener Justin Greaves notably slammed his maiden century in the match, providing a significant anchor for his team's innings. This milestone performance set a challenging tone in the early stages of the contest.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-27/india-vs-west-indies-live-score-1st-odi-kuldeep-yadav-tears-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>However, the momentum of the game took a dramatic turn with the introduction of India's spinner, Kuldeep Yadav. Yadav quickly asserted his dominance, causing considerable havoc through the West Indies batting order. His impactful spell saw him scalping two crucial wickets in successive deliveries, a significant blow that disrupted the opposition's rhythm and strategy.</p><p>Yadav's ability to break partnerships and create pressure proved pivotal, especially after Greaves' century had established a strong base. The spinner's rapid double strike underscored his reputation as a wicket-taking threat and shifted the balance of power in India's favour during the 1st ODI. The match continues to unfold with this significant development shaping the live updates.</p><p>What to watch: The continuing impact of Kuldeep Yadav's spell and West Indies' response in the 1st ODI.</p>
