     <article class="story single" data-beat="finance">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">FINANCE</span> · Livemint Money · 2026-09-27 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Manufacturing mutual funds: Top scheme delivered over 23% in 1 year—did this stellar return come with higher risk?</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Personal Finance</span> <span>#Mutual Funds</span> <span>#Investing</span> <span>#Manufacturing Sector</span></div>
       <p>For ordinary savers and taxpayers exploring investment avenues, manufacturing mutual funds have recently shown impressive performance. Over the past year, these funds have reportedly outpaced their benchmarks, with some top schemes delivering returns exceeding 23%. This strong showing might catch the eye of those looking for growth in their portfolios.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-27/manufacturing-mutual-funds-top-scheme-delivered-over-23-in-1.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>However, a crucial aspect of investing is understanding that higher returns often come hand-in-hand with increased risk. While the stellar performance of manufacturing mutual funds is notable, the summary prompts an important question for investors: did these additional returns necessitate taking on higher levels of volatility? For an ordinary saver, this means considering not just how much money was made, but also how much fluctuation and potential downside the investment experienced to achieve those gains.</p><p>It is important for individuals to look beyond just the headline returns. Understanding the risk profile, or how much volatility an investment entails, is fundamental for making informed decisions. Savers should assess if the level of risk associated with these funds aligns with their personal risk tolerance before considering any investment. This principle holds true for all investment choices, emphasizing prudence over chasing high returns alone.</p><p>What to watch: Further analysis on the risk-adjusted returns and long-term sustainability of manufacturing mutual funds.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article correctly interprets the source summary regarding the performance and risk profile of manufacturing mutual funds.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.livemint.com/money/personal-finance/manufacturing-mutual-funds-top-scheme-delivered-over-23-in-1-year-did-this-stellar-return-come-with-higher-risk-11790528372710.html" rel="noopener">Livemint Money</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
