     <article class="story single" data-beat="positive">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">POSITIVE</span> · The Better India · 2026-09-27 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Mumbai Demonstrates Exemplary Civic Responsibility During Ganpati Visarjan</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Mumbai</span> <span>#Ganpati Visarjan</span> <span>#Civic Sense</span> <span>#Environmental Responsibility</span></div>
       <p>Mumbai has witnessed a remarkable and heartening transformation in civic responsibility during this year's Ganpati Visarjan. In a powerful display of community effort and environmental consciousness, the number of Ganpati murtis found abandoned on the city's beaches dramatically decreased from hundreds last year to a mere six this year. This significant reduction underscores a profound positive shift in public behavior and a collective commitment to cleaner surroundings.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-27/mumbai-demonstrates-exemplary-civic-responsibility-during-ga.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This inspiring change is being celebrated as a key success for The Better India’s Civic Sense Revolution, an initiative championed by Rithvik Dhanjani. The campaign consistently highlights that genuine civic sense is not merely about cleanup efforts on a single day, but rather about fostering a continuous, everyday change in behavior. Mumbai’s exemplary conduct during the Ganpati Visarjan serves as a compelling testament to what can be achieved when citizens actively embrace and uphold their collective responsibility. The community's dedication to ensuring a respectful and environmentally conscious farewell to Ganpati Bappa truly showed that Mumbai understood the assignment, establishing a new benchmark for responsible festivities.</p><p>Why it matters: This collective effort showcases the power of community responsibility in fostering environmental awareness and improving civic behavior for lasting impact.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article effectively captures the essence of the source and the specific statistics provided.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://thebetterindia.com/videos/this-ganpati-visarjan-mumbai-understood-the-assignment-12581481" rel="noopener">The Better India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/mumbai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mumbai</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
