     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-09-27 · editor 6/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Nani says ‘The Paradise’ reactions show the trust and expectations audiences had</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Nani</span> <span>#Srikanth Odela</span> <span>#The Paradise</span> <span>#Audience Reactions</span></div>
       <p>Actor Nani and director Srikanth Odela have openly addressed the diverse audience reactions to their latest film, &quot;The Paradise.&quot; The creative duo reflected on the polarized views that emerged post-release, acknowledging the necessity of allowing time for a full comprehension of the feedback.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-27/nani-says-the-paradise-reactions-show-the-trust-and-expectat.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Director Srikanth Odela expressed his astonishment at the starkly differing opinions, indicating the film's ability to provoke strong responses. Nani, while anticipating varied reactions due to the film's unique narrative, highlighted its profound impact and distinctive storytelling approach. Both agreed that the intensity of the audience's engagement underscored the high level of trust and expectation placed in their collaborative work.</p><p>The strong box office performance of &quot;The Paradise&quot; was cited by Nani and Srikanth as a clear indicator of audience confidence in their partnership. They affirmed their intention to meticulously analyze all viewer feedback, planning to integrate these insights into the development and enhancement of their future cinematic projects. This approach suggests a commitment to evolving their craft based on direct audience interaction.</p><p>What to watch: Nani and Srikanth Odela's future projects, informed by audience feedback from &quot;The Paradise.&quot;</p>
       
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/telugu/movies/news/nani-and-srikanth-odela-discuss-the-paradise-response-i-dont-understand-what-it-is-says-director-actor-says-it-shows-the-trust-and-expectations-audiences-had-from-them/articleshow/134521910.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
