      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/world/pakistan-tops-global-terrorism-index-2026-husain-haqqani-reaction-ws-l-10355164.html" rel="noopener">News18 World</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
