      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/cricket/ro-ko-record-hunt-rohit-virat-eye-several-milestones-ahead-of-1st-odi-against-wi-12103535#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
